  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rasametti Venkateswara Rao, vs State Of Ap on 23 October, 2019 Author: T. Rajani Bench: T. Rajani Smt. Justice T.Rajani Criminal Petition No. 6368 Of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "2. Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and learned Public Prosecutor appearing for the respondent-State. 3. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the issues raised in this criminal petition are squarely covered by common order of High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the State of Telangana and the State of Andhra Pradesh in Criminal Petition Nos. 3731 of 2018 and batch dated 27-08-2018, whereby the Court [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against the petitioners therein for the offences punishable under Indian Penal Code and Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, while permitting the prosecution to proceed with the offences punishable under the provisions of the Act of 2003. 4.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and learned Public Prosecutor appearing for the respondent-State. 3. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the issues raised in this criminal petition are squarely covered by common order of High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the State of Telangana and the State of Andhra Pradesh in Criminal Petition Nos. 3731 of 2018 and batch dated 27-08-2018, whereby the Court [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against the petitioners therein for the offences punishable under Indian Penal Code and Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, while permitting the prosecution to proceed with the offences punishable under the provisions of the Act of 2003. 4.",
